  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Adolescent Girls and Young Women through Education in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Office in Bamako in close collaboration with Ministries of Education; Health; Vocational training; and Women, children and family; and under the framework of UNESCO-UNFPA-UN Women Joint Programme for the Empowerment of Adolescent Girls and Young Women will implement a project entitled &quot;Empowering adolescent girls and young women through education in Mali&quot; to enhance access to quality and relevant education for adolescent girls and young women. The project will be implemented in three regions of Mali (Segou, Mopti and Tombouctou) as well as in the District of Bamako.</narrative>
  </description>
